<view class="page location-page"><view class="location-symbol">到店</view><text class="eyebrow">隐私与定位</text><text class="title">仅在需要时获取位置</text><text class="muted location-copy">{{message}}</text><view class="location-notes"><text>用于门店现场打卡</text><text>不启动持续定位</text><text>最终范围由系统判定</text></view><button wx:if="{{status !== 'ready'}}" class="primary" loading="{{status === 'loading'}}" bindtap="locate">{{status === 'blocked' ? '重新定位' : '允许获取位置'}}</button><button wx:if="{{status === 'blocked'}}" class="secondary" bindtap="openSettings">打开设置</button><button wx:if="{{status === 'ready'}}" class="primary" bindtap="continue">{{continueLabel}}</button></view>
